{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/titlebg_1_en.png?t=1748089460\" /></div><strong>&quot;Loafing Town&quot;</strong> is a <strong>desktop idle game</strong> designed for PC\u2014your ultimate workday distraction!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/GIF_2025-4-26_19-43-09.gif?t=1748089460\" /></div> Step into the role of a god-like overseer and build a thriving hero village. Starting with just a lone hero and a simple thatched hut, you'll gradually attract more heroes and transform your humble village into a bustling town.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/\u5e8f\u5217_01.gif?t=1748089460\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/titlebg_2_en.png?t=1748089460\" /></div>The gameplay is simple yet engaging: <strong>summon monsters</strong> to train heroes, <strong>earn gold</strong> to develop the village, <strong>upgrade houses and facilities</strong>, <strong>cast magic</strong> to assist heroes in battle, and even <strong>sacrifice heroes</strong> for unexpected rewards!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/boss.gif?t=1748089460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a <strong>god-view grabbing system</strong> and a <strong>physics-based interaction</strong>, the game delivers a delightful sandbox experience, perfect for idle play during work or study breaks. Watch your village grow and enjoy the laid-back charm of progression.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/\u732e\u796d.gif?t=1748089460\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/titlebg_3_en.png?t=1748089460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to slack off not only in the game but also in the community, come join us and chat together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please follow me on X! @Tenffy_Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like <i>Loafing Town</i>, don't forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625210?t=1748089460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625210?t=1748089460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/3ac7df76af4d83ed1ccb6d5bcc594ca65d5b0d77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748089460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/3ac7df76af4d83ed1ccb6d5bcc594ca65d5b0d77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748089460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/titlebg_1_en.png?t=1748089460\" /></div><strong>&quot;Loafing Town&quot;</strong> is a <strong>desktop idle game</strong> designed for PC\u2014your ultimate workday distraction!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/GIF_2025-4-26_19-43-09.gif?t=1748089460\" /></div> Step into the role of a god-like overseer and build a thriving hero village. Starting with just a lone hero and a simple thatched hut, you'll gradually attract more heroes and transform your humble village into a bustling town.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/\u5e8f\u5217_01.gif?t=1748089460\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/titlebg_2_en.png?t=1748089460\" /></div>The gameplay is simple yet engaging: <strong>summon monsters</strong> to train heroes, <strong>earn gold</strong> to develop the village, <strong>upgrade houses and facilities</strong>, <strong>cast magic</strong> to assist heroes in battle, and even <strong>sacrifice heroes</strong> for unexpected rewards!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/boss.gif?t=1748089460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a <strong>god-view grabbing system</strong> and a <strong>physics-based interaction</strong>, the game delivers a delightful sandbox experience, perfect for idle play during work or study breaks. Watch your village grow and enjoy the laid-back charm of progression.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/\u732e\u796d.gif?t=1748089460\" /></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/titlebg_3_en.png?t=1748089460\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to slack off not only in the game but also in the community, come join us and chat together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please follow me on X! @Tenffy_Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like <i>Loafing Town</i>, don't forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["GoblinZz"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/f58463cb5e882ed61193c04362ceee49fc962bb8/header.jpg?t=1748089460","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140896,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140896/movie480.mp4?t=1747485908","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140896/movie_max.mp4?t=1747485908"},"name":"LoafingTown Trailer_default","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140896/35aa96c0ddee58714436a0a3a0935f35f766c020/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747485908","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140896/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747485908","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140896/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747485908"}}],"name":"Loafing Town","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+, Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU with OpenGL 3.2 / DirectX 10 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650 / AMD equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["GoblinZz"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"